      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GABBYS SPORTSTAR (7) has been competitive of late. Continued good form when 2.5 metres from the winner in second over 1660m at this track last time. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage and he can take care of this line-up if and when it comes. TENEACHWAY (1) is another in good form at present. Finished third at his latest appearance over 1660m at this track, beaten 3.5 metres. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. BROOKLYN BANDIT (10) fronts up off a couple of seconds recently, the latest at this track over 1660m. Capable of turning this good form into what would be a well-deserved win while ORANGE FEVER (5) is worth some thought after his last-start fifth over 1660m at this track on August 14.",
